'''Ultima Beast Naala''' (超古獣ナーラ, ''Chō Kojū Nāra'', '''Super Ancient Beast Naala''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] enemy introduced in [[Immortal Zenith]], the final stage in [[Behemoth's Peak]]. It is the enemy version of [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Elder Beast Naala]]. It was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]].

