==Enemy==
Ultima Beast Naala stands at 400 range and has a multi-hit attack that covers three separate 200px areas in front of it, reaching up to 600 range on the last hit. The second and third hits deal half as much damage, so long-ranged units may not be punished as harshly as those in the frontlines, but all will be frozen and cursed regardless. Besides that, it has a massive health pool and is immune to [[Surge Attack|Surges]]. This would all make for a truly fearsome opponent or a relatively weak adversary depending on what threat Naala is paired with.

